#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:5
msgid "A complete apply_chunk job"
msgstr "完整作业示例"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:7
msgid ""
"This example reads application logs from ``source_table``, with ``id`` as "
"the DataFrame index. The UDF extracts fields and flags slow requests in "
"batches. The job writes the result to ``target_table`` and reads back a few "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"这个例子从 ``source_table`` 读取应用日志，以 ``id`` 作为 DataFrame 索引。UDF "
"分批提取字段并标记慢请求，作业将结果写入 ``target_table``，再读回几行查看。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:11
msgid ""
"Before running the example, set the MaxCompute credentials, project, and "
"endpoint in the environment variables used below. Replace the source and "
"target table names with the actual names."
msgstr "运行前，先设置代码中使用的 MaxCompute 凭证、项目和 Endpoint 环境变量，并将源表、目标表替换为实际表名。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:15
msgid ""
"The source table must contain ``id`` and ``raw_log`` columns. ``id`` "
"identifies each record, and ``raw_log`` contains the log text. For example, "
"the illustrative input ``id=101`` and ``raw_log=\"[INFO] latency=800ms\"`` "
"produces ``level=\"INFO\"``, ``latency_ms=800.0``, and ``is_slow=True``, "
"with ``101`` kept as the row index."
msgstr ""
"源表需要包含 ``id`` 和 ``raw_log`` 两列：``id`` 用于标识记录，``raw_log`` 保存日志文本。例如，示意输入 "
"``id=101``、``raw_log=\"[INFO] latency=800ms\"`` 对应的输出是 "
"``level=\"INFO\"``、``latency_ms=800.0``、``is_slow=True``，行索引仍为 ``101``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:21
msgid ""
"The example uses ``overwrite=True``, which replaces existing data in "
"``target_table``, and ``index=True`` so the ``id`` index is written as a "
"column."
msgstr ""
"示例使用 ``overwrite=True``，会覆盖 ``target_table`` 中的已有数据；``index=True`` 会把 ``id``"
" 索引作为一列写入。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:76
msgid ""
"If the source contains only the illustrative record above, the read-back "
"result is:"
msgstr "如果源表中只有上面的示例记录，读回的结果为："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:85
msgid "When adapting this example, check these settings:"
msgstr "使用这段代码时，需要留意几项设置："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:87
msgid ""
"``odps_entry=o`` supplies the connection when reading each table. "
"``o.to_global()`` sets the PyODPS default used by ``to_odps_table``. "
"Creating a MaxFrame session does not set that default."
msgstr ""
"``odps_entry=o`` 显式指定读表所用的连接。``o.to_global()`` 设置 ``to_odps_table`` 使用的 "
"PyODPS 默认连接；创建 MaxFrame 会话不会自动设置这个默认值。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:91
msgid ""
"``new_session(o)`` creates the MaxFrame session, and "
"``get_logview_address()`` returns the Logview link for checking progress and"
" errors."
msgstr ""
"``new_session(o)`` 创建 MaxFrame 会话，``get_logview_address()`` 获取 Logview "
"链接，方便查看进度和错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:95
msgid ""
"``@with_running_options(cpu=2, memory=\"8GiB\")`` requests 2 CPUs and 8 GiB "
"of memory for each task running the function while following the job's "
"default execution engine. Adjust these values for the workload; see "
":ref:`udf_tuning_resources`."
msgstr ""
"``@with_running_options(cpu=2, memory=\"8GiB\")`` 为每个运行该函数的任务申请 2 个 CPU 和 8 "
"GiB 内存，执行引擎沿用作业默认设置。这些值需要按实际计算调整，选值方法见 :ref:`udf_tuning_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:100
msgid ""
"The return annotation declares the output columns and dtypes. The function "
"preserves the input ``id`` index; see :ref:`udf_result_index`."
msgstr "返回类型注解声明了输出列和数据类型。函数保留了输入的 ``id`` 索引，索引的声明方法见 :ref:`udf_result_index`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/complete_job.rst:103
msgid ""
"Reading the table and calling ``apply_chunk`` build the calculation. "
"Executing ``to_odps_table`` submits the calculation and table write. The "
"final read checks up to five saved rows; ``fetch()`` returns them as a "
"pandas DataFrame. Row order is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"读表和调用 ``apply_chunk`` 只构建计算过程。对 ``to_odps_table`` 调用 ``execute`` "
"才会提交计算并写表。最后一次读取用于检查已保存的数据，最多返回五行；``fetch()`` 将它们取回为 pandas "
"DataFrame。结果的行顺序不固定。"
